# Relay Complete UI/UX Redesign

Complete visual and UX overhaul of the Relay dashboard (Next.js) and browser extension (Plasmo), plus inline chips and toasts. Strip the AI-generated feel, apply strong product judgment, and create a calm, premium, coding-first interface.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Design system**: Keeping monochrome/neutral palette (current is near-perfect). Tightening radii, removing green remnants, ensuring theme sync between dashboard ↔ extension ↔ inline chips ↔ toasts. Extension sidebar moves from pitch-black to softer dark matching dashboard dark mode.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Typography**: Switching from Outfit to **Geist** (Vercel's font). More modern, better readability at small sizes, pairs with the product's coding focus. If you prefer to keep Outfit, let me know.

> [!WARNING]
> **Scope**: This touches nearly every UI file across dashboard and extension. The plan prioritizes keeping all existing business logic intact while replacing the visual layer. Tests will be updated accordingly.

