## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

**Existing tests (update mocks for renamed components):**
```bash
pnpm test
```
This runs vitest across the monorepo. Key tests to update:
- `apps/web/src/app/dashboard/page.test.tsx` — update AppShell mock, verify new tab headings render
- `apps/extension/src/components/control-panel-state.test.ts` — no structural changes needed

**Lint:**
```bash
pnpm lint
```

**Typecheck:**
```bash
pnpm -r typecheck
```

**Extension build:**
```bash
pnpm --filter @relay/extension build
```

**Web build:**
```bash
pnpm --filter @relay/web build
```

